==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|rihtec}}, from {{inh|de|goh|rihtīg}}, from {{m|goh|reht||right}} + {{m|goh|-ig}}. Equivalent to {{suf|de|recht|ig}}. Originally only an adjective; adverb developed later.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʀɪçtɪç/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-richtig.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-richtig.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

